<view class="page profile-page">
  <view class="page-head"><view class="eyebrow">我的账号 · 可选资料</view><view class="title">{{fromLogin ? '欢迎加入飞毛腿' : '编辑账号资料'}}</view><view class="page-desc">昵称就是平台显示用户名，无需另设用户名或头像。暂不完善也不影响微信登录。</view></view>
  <view class="loading-note" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在读取账号资料与授权状态…</view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{error}}"><view class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="secondary" disabled="{{loading || saving || binding || checkingPrivacy || openingPrivacy}}" bindtap="load">重新读取资料与授权状态</button></view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{loaded}}">
    <view class="section-title">平台昵称 <text class="optional">选填</text></view>
    <view class="field"><label class="label" for="profile-nickname">你希望大家如何称呼你</label><input id="profile-nickname" type="nickname" maxlength="64" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="input" bindblur="input" disabled="{{loading || saving || binding || checkingPrivacy || openingPrivacy}}" placeholder="填写昵称，或使用微信昵称"/></view>
    <view class="hint">保存时去除首尾空格，限1至32个字符，不含控制字符。只有点击保存才会更新昵称。</view>
    <button class="secondary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{loading || saving || binding || checkingPrivacy || openingPrivacy}}" bindtap="save">保存昵称</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{loaded}}">
    <view class="section-title">绑定手机号 <text class="optional">选填</text></view>
    <view class="phone-status" wx:if="{{mobileBound}}"><view class="success">手机号已绑定</view><view class="hint">{{mobile || '号码已脱敏保护'}}</view></view>
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="hint">仅在您主动点击下方按钮并授权后，将微信返回的临时凭证发送至服务端绑定手机号。拒绝授权不会退出登录，也不会影响继续使用。</view>
      <view class="notice" wx:if="{{nickname !== savedNickname}}">昵称修改尚未保存。绑定手机号不会自动保存昵称，请单独点击“保存昵称”。</view>
      <view class="hint" wx:if="{{!phoneSupported}}">当前微信版本不支持安全绑定手机号，请升级微信后重试，或暂时跳过。</view>
      <block wx:elif="{{privacyNeeded}}">
        <button class="text-button privacy-link" bindtap="openPrivacy" disabled="{{loading || saving || binding || checkingPrivacy || openingPrivacy}}">查看{{privacyTitle}}</button>
        <button wx:if="{{privacyGateSupported}}" id="agree-profile-privacy" open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization" bindagreeprivacyauthorization="agreePrivacy" class="secondary" loading="{{checkingPrivacy}}" disabled="{{loading || saving || binding || checkingPrivacy || openingPrivacy}}">同意隐私指引，继续手机号授权</button>
        <view class="hint" wx:else>请升级微信以完成隐私授权，您也可以跳过。</view>
      </block>
      <button wx:elif="{{privacyReady}}" class="primary" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindtap="preparePhone" bindgetphonenumber="bindPhone" loading="{{binding}}" disabled="{{loading || saving || binding || checkingPrivacy || openingPrivacy}}">授权并绑定微信手机号</button>
      <view class="hint" wx:else>隐私状态尚未确认，可重试读取或直接跳过。</view>
    </block>
    <view class="hint">绑定信息不会自动填入订单联系人电话，也不会自动合并短信账号。若号码已用于其他账号，请按服务端提示处理。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="profile-actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="complete" disabled="{{!loaded || loading || saving || binding || checkingPrivacy || openingPrivacy}}">完成并继续</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="leave" disabled="{{saving || binding}}">{{fromLogin ? '暂时跳过，继续使用' : '返回（不保存昵称修改）'}}</button></view>
  <view class="footer-note">可随时从“我的 → 账号资料”回来修改。</view>
</view>
